<h2>Music</h2>
<p>The music: a main theme, a funky tutorial theme, a jingle for the made-up publisher PlaySmart Interactive, and a track for each museum stage: Ancient Greece, Egypt and the Aztecs. The stage tracks share a tempo, key and length, so the music can move smoothly from one to the next, and the HUD sounds are tuned to the same key.</p>

